  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook snacking tomatoes, stirring occasionally, until blistered, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.\n• Pour boiling water into a large saucepan over high heat. Add a pinch of salt, then bring to the boil. Cook fettuccine in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 9 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people), then drain pasta and return to pan. Drizzle with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637d54a1c31123a544004243/step-dcdf08b4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pasta is cooking, grate zucchini. Thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• In a large bowl, combine a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season with salt and pepper. Add apple, flaked almonds and mixed salad leaves. Set aside. TIP: Toss the salad just before serving to keep the leaves crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637d54a1c31123a544004243/step-ddd296c7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook zucchini, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in light cooking cream and vegetable stock pot and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Stir in basil pesto, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using), fettuccine and reserved pasta water until heated through. Remove pan from heat. Stir in blistered tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637d54a1c31123a544004243/step-357251c8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Season pasta to taste. Toss salad to coat.\n• Divide pesto and cherry tomato pasta between bowls. Sprinkle with shaved Parmesan cheese.\n• Serve with apple and almond salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/637d54a1c31123a544004243/step-a49414a6.jpg"
    }
  ]
